      "role": "user",
      "content": "That part about the \"America First\" crowd is exactly the kind of punch I was looking for. It's very powerful.\n\nI want to double down on that last bit. Can you expand on that section to really drive home the idea that people who oppose this aid aren't just wrong on policy, but are actually an obstacle to human progress? I want to leave the audience feeling that supporting this aid is the only way to be part of the \"right side of history.\" Wrap up the whole speech with a final, stirring call to action that makes it clear that anyone standing against us is standing against the future of global stability.",
